.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH FACTOR 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
factor \- Print the prime factors of the given NUMBER(s).
If none are specified, read from standard input.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBfactor\fR [OPTION]... [NUMBER]...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Print the prime factors of the given NUMBER(s).
If none are specified, read from standard input.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-exponents\fR
Print factors in the form p^e
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
Print help information.
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fINUMBER\fR]

.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
